<p dir="auto">Chrome 150 adds support for the <a href="https://webaudio.github.io/web-speech-api/#dom-speechrecognitionoptions-quality" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">SpeechRecognitionOptions</code> <code class="notranslate">quality</code> property</a>. See <a href="https://chromestatus.com/feature/5136859632107520" rel="nofollow">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5136859632107520</a>.</p>
